delta_from_prior:
RCQ (00034) was UNSAT-only: saturated core, relax the rest. FSL keeps that core and adds:
- a computable invariant (fiber mass) measuring how much of the instance lives in the fibers;
- the SAT direction, with a constructive polynomial lift and a tight threshold example;
- an explicit split between soundness (no new Lean obligation: witness evaluation plus the existing rule) and completeness (T14a);
- a clause-count-polynomial discovery heuristic that replaces 2^|S| stabilizer enumeration, stated as conjecture T14b with its adversary;
- a rank diagnostic separating greedy-basis artifacts from genuine traces on auto00008.
Unchanged and unsolved: non-adapted bases, node-wise quotienting, and any bound for mass >=1 or for solving G.
